# Spark IDE keymap - proven long-form save/run/show.
# After new forms. Short s/r/w already proven - this slice documents
# full-word script aliases save/run/show (same cmds, not new tokens).
# Dry: save/run JSON trace only; show validates PPM; open paints.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_keys_long_srs.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven keys only.

ide keys "examples/fixtures/ide/cmds_long_srs.txt"

ide key save

ide key run

ide key show
